Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 06:59:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 286: rank 8 falsifies capacity - the reading is a lookup key,
 so strip identity

--frozen-trunk --read-rank 8, same tapes. The reading path shrank 12.8x -
65,536 to 5,120 trainable parameters, projection included, which the first
head_norms accounting missed and now counts - and the train fit did not move:
accuracy 0.897 @ 0.690 identical to the digit, control AUC 0.986 -> 0.996.
Held out it is the same collapse as full width: 0.353 accuracy, unknown AUC
0.302 at -2.3 sigma (inverted, third time), lying tape 0.143 at 0.689
coverage.

A 12.8x capacity cut that changes neither the fit nor the failure means
capacity was never the binding constraint. Hypothesis (b) follows (a) into the
ground, and the mechanism left standing is the input itself: a text with its
names in it is a unique identifier, and a lookup table over unique identifiers
is cheap at any width. The head does not need 65k parameters to key 1,008
examples - 5k did it identically.

So the third arm strips identity instead of width. --read-anon folds the
subject and every candidate value in the READ text to constant common words
("someone" / "something"), leaving only the phrasing - which is the one part
of a reading that could conceivably transfer between disjoint corpus halves.
Stated before the run, so the result can falsify it: the train control may
stay memorised regardless, because an anonymised sentence is still a unique
string; the decision is held-out only. If anon beats nohid there, phrasing
carries signal. If it ties, reading adds nothing at this tape size and nohid
IS the model. If it still inverts, the channel gets dropped and the stage's
verdict is that judgment lives in the counters.

The run also caught a gate lying by omission. G_weighs_contested passed at
0.152 against votes' 0.121 while every other gate failed: two scorers under
the floor, ranked solemnly. Random choice among the candidates is the null
that comparison forgot - expected accuracy of a uniform pick, computed per
example from the candidate count and the target's presence, no constant
anywhere. by_evidence_shape now reports random_accuracy_contested and the
gate requires beating it; under that rule this run's lone TRUE flips FALSE.

